                You and your traveling companions are deemed to have read, understood and accepted the following tour booking terms and conditions.
                Chariot Travels Pte Ltd shall be referred to as "Company" in the terms and conditions below.
            </p>
            <p>The terms and conditions below apply for both group tour and flexi holidays booking, unless otherwise stated.</p>
